{"id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-tree-property.md","title":"Tree Property","display":"df-tree-property — Tree Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tree-property","aliases":["58-df-tree-property"],"display":"df-tree-property — Tree Property","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tree-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tree-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree-property — Tree Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal.md\">58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\)</span>（树谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\ne t\\}\">\\(P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\ne t\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\">\\(P_t\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 所诱导严格良序下的序型）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha(T,R)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)=\\alpha\\}\">\\(L_\\alpha(T,R)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)=\\alpha\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash \\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|L_\\alpha(T,R)|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash \\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|L_\\alpha(T,R)|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch}\\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow b\\subseteq T\\land\\forall s,t\\in b\\;\\bigl(s=t\\lor\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl|b\\cap L_\\alpha(T,R)\\bigr|=1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch}\\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow b\\subseteq T\\land\\forall s,t\\in b\\;\\bigl(s=t\\lor\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl|b\\cap L_\\alpha(T,R)\\bigr|=1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}property}\\vdash \\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall T,R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\to\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}property}\\vdash \\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall T,R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\to\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>树性质断言每棵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-树都有贯穿所有层的余终分支。</li>\n<li>ZFC 中存在 Aronszajn 树，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 不具有树性质。</li>\n<li>每个弱紧基数都具有树性质；这是后续定理而非定义的一部分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)$（树谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)","display":false},{"tex":"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\ne t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)","display":false},{"tex":"P_t","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha(T,R)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)=\\alpha\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash \\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{ht}_R(t)<\\kappa\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\bigl(0<|L_\\alpha(T,R)|<\\kappa\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}branch}\\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow b\\subseteq T\\land\\forall s,t\\in b\\;\\bigl(s=t\\lor\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\bigl|b\\cap L_\\alpha(T,R)\\bigr|=1","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tree\\text{-}property}\\vdash \\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall T,R\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\to\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1917,"backlinks":[{"id":"57395293cfef9d3f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]])"},{"id":"059acbe8570b41df","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S$ and $\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-tree-property]]"},{"id":"36754a003d184a02","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"The tree and branch predicates now come from [[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]], while the generalized Aronszajn predicate comes from [[58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree]]; the former tree/branch links did not define the symbols used in the assertion."},{"id":"aa9cb1cb7b132eb4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S$（$\\kappa$-树谓词，见 [[58-df-tree-property]]）"},{"id":"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)$ and $\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)$ (tree predicates, see [[58-df-tree-property]])"},{"id":"f9a277222c5924f6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md|58-df-tree-proper